{"type":"message","id":"8a7fb38d","parentId":"31530ba8","timestamp":"2026-04-15T08:11:46.731Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's 1 task in the tasklist. Let me get its details. The task due timestamp is 1775368800000 which is in milliseconds. Let me check when that is.\n\n1775368800000 ms = 1775368800 seconds\nFrom 1970 to 2026 is about 56 years. 56*365.25*24*3600 ≈ 176,73x million seconds.\n1775368800 - 1767302400 = 8066400 seconds\n8066400 / 86400 ≈ 93 days from Jan 1, 2026\nSo about April 2026.\n\nCurrent time is April 15, 2026 8:11 AM UTC. The task is \"填写天津瑞湾每周核心关注事项表\" - fill in the weekly core attention matters form for Tianjin Rui Bay.\n\n\nThe timestamp 1775368800000 converts to April 17, 2026 at 4:00 AM UTC, which is April 17 at noon Beijing time. Since today is April 15, there's still about two days before this task is due.\n\nNow I need to check the progress repository in the shared pool to see what updates have been made there. The cron job is asking me to update my last heartbeat time, mark any tasks that haven't been updated in over 60 minutes as Dead, and report progress to the shared pool work progress database. Let me look for the shared pool's progress tracking table in Feishu."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3o46hmoq4hlp_1","name":"feishu_search_doc_wiki","arguments":{"action":"search","query":"共享池 工作进度"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776240696580,"responseId":"062e7b381e25e410598d5d57a6df2c9d"}}
